rvices, financial services and lifestyle and leisure.","title":"Vanessa Gounden"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" She served in Nelson Mandela's ANC administration during the 1990s.","title":"Vanessa Gounden"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" She is South Africa's first female mining magnate and one of South Africa's most successful female entrepreneurs.","title":"Vanessa Gounden"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" Vanessa Gounden is an inspirational and driven businesswoman who has made a name for herself in notoriously difficult industries as diverse as mining to fashion.","title":"Vanessa Gounden"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Albu Baronetcy, of Grosvenor Place in the City of Westminster, and Johannesburg in the Province of Transvaal in the Union of South Africa, is a title in the Baronetage of the United Kingdom.","title":"Albu baronets"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It was created on 12 February 1912 for the South African mining magnate George Albu.","title":"Albu baronets"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" He was the founder of the General Mining and Finance Corporation alongside his brother Leopold Albu.","title":"Albu baronets"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" s of 2017 the title is held by the first Baronet's grandson, the third Baronet, who succeeded his father in 1963.","title":"Albu baronets"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Sir Robert Thorne Coryndon
